  annotation "note_1771579888276_2", anchor: "Four memorial laws were enacted: Foedus∴vincu", text: "Foedus∴vincu was not enacted after the Vum∴tenebra. It was recommissioned. The charter predates this conflagration by at least two wars. Three of these four are commemorations; one is a founding document scarred into reuse. The difference matters. I should have caught it before it reached the apparatus.", type: :pedantic, display: :popout
